{"id":"Cb1dacd83f64bb4e5a7f2","zh":"能量谱","en":"energy spectrum","domain":"轨道不平顺与信号处理","definition_zh":"信号能量随分析尺度或频率等变量的分布表示。","definition_en":null,"usage_note":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_overview":"用于轨道检测信号的能量分布表征，从时间、尺度或二者的联合域观察信号能量如何分布，为分析检测信号提供不同分析域下的能量表示。","translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[{"id":"Cb1dacd83f64bb4e5a7f2","zh":"能量谱","en":"energy spectrum","domain":"轨道不平顺与信号处理","group_id":"H145fe5dbdf7760c14561","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"轨道不平顺与信号处理 · 徐磊等（2014）"}],"designations":[{"id":"Dbd7adc691361b6c35e71","language":"zh","role":"headword","text":"能量谱"},{"id":"D27b9e18e7ace29c7c3ae","language":"en","role":"headword","text":"energy spectrum"}],"sources":{"P102":{"id":"P102","title":"小波能量谱在铁路轨道检测中的应用","authors":"徐磊,陈宪麦,徐伟昌,李晓建,孟宪洪,唐永康","year":"2014","doi":"10.16385/j.cnki.issn.1004-4523.2014.04.015","journal_citation":"振动工程学报","label":"徐磊等（2014）","overview_slug":"2014-wavelet-energy-spectrum-track-inspection"}},"complete_examples":[{"id":"S81cc0252772e6074cde8","source_id":"P102","page":8,"page_end":8,"language":"en","text":"Based on the continue wavelet transform′s detailed performance in time-scale mesh generation, and combined with the probability method, the time, scale and time-scale wavelet energy spectrum of train vibration response and track irregularity signal was estab-lished after the calculating and analyzing of track irregularity and train vibration energy, then the combined diagnosis and analysis was conducted.","citations":[{"source_id":"P102","page":8,"page_end":8}]},{"id":"S1eb03ee940b4c70d11fd","source_id":"P102","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"根据上述定律与思想,本文采用基于连续小波变换的能量谱方法,对沪宁客运专线和朔黄重载铁路的轨道不平顺及列车振动响应的轨检数据进行时(频)域能量的联合分析。","citations":[{"source_id":"P102","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"Sdaba472f87c3290e1f3b","source_id":"P102","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"基于连续小波变换细致的时间-尺度网格划分性能,结合概率方法,通过对轨道不平顺和列车振动信号的能量计算与分析,建立列车振动响应和轨道不平顺信号的时间、尺度和时间-尺度小波能量谱,并进行联合诊断。","citations":[{"source_id":"P102","page":1,"page_end":1}]}],"related_terms":[{"id":"C06e702c355a348cd6792","target_concept_id":"C06e702c355a348cd6792","target_zh":"连续小波变换","target_en":"continuous wavelet transform","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C97c8dc0588c36420f091","target_concept_id":"C97c8dc0588c36420f091","target_zh":"小波能量谱","target_en":"wavelet energy spectrum","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C1662045a471dc4c9dd4e","target_concept_id":"C1662045a471dc4c9dd4e","target_zh":"概率方法","target_en":"probabilistic method","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"Cd6d4ea1d7e05aa0361f7","target_concept_id":"Cd6d4ea1d7e05aa0361f7","target_zh":"轨道不平顺","target_en":"track irregularity","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"Ce74a1368abba0ac9c801","target_concept_id":"Ce74a1368abba0ac9c801","target_zh":"小波变换","target_en":"wavelet transform","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C95bb3e5dd1c60c4ca3a5","target_concept_id":"C95bb3e5dd1c60c4ca3a5","target_zh":"振动能量","target_en":"vibration energy","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C6191468cc8350c05b95d","target_concept_id":"C6191468cc8350c05b95d","target_zh":"时间-尺度","target_en":"time-scale","label":"同句术语","reason":null}],"suggested_comparisons":[],"relations":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"families":[],"sense_choices":[],"related_sources":[{"id":"P102","title":"小波能量谱在铁路轨道检测中的应用","authors":"徐磊,陈宪麦,徐伟昌,李晓建,孟宪洪,唐永康","year":"2014","doi":"10.16385/j.cnki.issn.1004-4523.2014.04.015","journal_citation":"振动工程学报","label":"徐磊等（2014）","overview_slug":"2014-wavelet-energy-spectrum-track-inspection"}]}